{
    "version": "2.6.5",
    "description": "Microsoft Windows App Runtime (WindowsAppSDK) 2.6 - WinUI / WinAppSDK 应用依赖的运行时",
    "homepage": "https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/apps/windows-app-sdk/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Proprietary"
    },
    "checkver": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/WindowsAppSDK/releases/latest",
        "regex": "\"tag_name\":\\s*\"v?([\\d.]+)\""
    },
    "url": "https://aka.ms/windowsappsdk/2.6/2.6.5/windowsappruntimeinstall-x64.exe",
    "hash": "sha256:908e9a8ed8ad2ac765d6679543b0758812437e3ad6e3223f08d1730635cec8ec",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://aka.ms/windowsappsdk/$majorVersion.$minorVersion/$version/windowsappruntimeinstall-x64.exe"
    },
    "post_install": [
        "Start-Process -FilePath \"$dir\\windowsappruntimeinstall-x64.exe\" -ArgumentList '--quiet' -Wait"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "安装时自动执行 windowsappruntimeinstall-x64.exe --quiet，静默安装 Windows App Runtime（实测非管理员 exit 0）。",
        "该包只安装运行时，没有 bin/快捷方式；WinUI / WindowsAppSDK 应用依赖它运行。",
        "支持指定版本：scoop install winsdk@2.6.4 / winsdk@2.4.0（autoupdate 用 $majorVersion.$minorVersion 生成 aka.ms 路径）。"
    ]
}
